WEBVTT

1
00:35:35.714 --> 00:35:46.714
Jesus, it gives so much confidence in my heart to realize that I can give it all to You.

2
00:35:46.714 --> 00:35:55.714
And I bless You at home as well. I wish it for You. I bless it to You in the name of Jesus.

3
00:35:55.714 --> 00:36:03.714
That when You sing, You deserve the glory and everything comes from Him and is through Him

4
00:36:03.714 --> 00:36:10.714
and You can leave it all to Him. This gives so much peace and confidence in my heart

5
00:36:10.714 --> 00:36:18.714
to realize that I don't have to understand it all and that I don't have to do it all

6
00:36:18.714 --> 00:36:24.714
but that I can honor Him in faith for who He is.

7
00:36:24.714 --> 00:36:29.714
He is the Creator of heaven and earth. He is the Savior of humanity.

8
00:36:29.714 --> 00:36:35.714
He is the one who completes His plan and I get to be a part of it.

9
00:36:35.714 --> 00:36:41.714
Even if I don't understand it. Even if I don't like it sometimes.

10
00:36:41.714 --> 00:36:48.714
Even if I have success or no success. It is all from Him.

11
00:36:48.714 --> 00:36:52.714
That is amazing. This is amazing.

12
00:36:52.714 --> 00:37:00.714
There is no God or religion on earth where you can come to Him with all that you have and are.

13
00:37:00.714 --> 00:37:06.714
With that one Deity. It is always the case that you have to have it all together

14
00:37:06.714 --> 00:37:12.714
and only then can you present yourself perfectly to a certain Deity.

15
00:37:12.714 --> 00:37:17.714
But Jesus Christ has come to pay for your and my mistakes

16
00:37:17.714 --> 00:37:25.714
so that you can come to God with all that you have and are, with your success, with your happiness, with your peace

17
00:37:25.714 --> 00:37:32.714
with your problems, with your career or your unemployment, with your faith or lack thereof

18
00:37:32.714 --> 00:37:38.714
with your peace or your unrest, with everything you can come to God and say

19
00:37:38.714 --> 00:37:45.714
You can have it all, Lord. That is why He is Lord over everything.

20
00:37:46.714 --> 00:37:49.714
He is not Lord over perfect people.

21
00:37:49.714 --> 00:37:56.714
Jesus is Lord over prostitutes and tax collectors, says the Bible.

22
00:37:56.714 --> 00:38:00.714
Jesus is Lord over me.

23
00:38:00.714 --> 00:38:07.714
Because I am indeed that one person who belongs somewhere in the spectrum of people.

24
00:38:07.714 --> 00:38:13.714
I am a human, and Jesus has been human to be just like me.

25
00:38:13.714 --> 00:38:17.714
But He was perfect, yet paid for my sins.

26
00:38:17.714 --> 00:38:21.714
So that I can live in the perfection of Jesus.

27
00:38:21.714 --> 00:38:25.714
Because He died in the imperfection of Tim.

28
00:38:25.714 --> 00:38:28.714
That is why Jesus is my Lord.

29
00:38:28.714 --> 00:38:31.714
That is why He deserves my everything.

30
00:38:31.714 --> 00:38:36.714
He became my imperfection so that I could become His perfection.

31
00:38:36.714 --> 00:38:39.714
He has earned me.

32
00:38:39.714 --> 00:38:46.714
I give everything to Jesus. It is so wonderful.

33
00:38:46.714 --> 00:38:49.714
You are worth everything.

34
00:38:49.714 --> 00:38:54.714
Let's sing it one more time.

35
00:38:55.714 --> 00:38:59.714
Close your eyes for a moment and give everything to Him.

36
00:38:59.714 --> 00:39:01.714
Come on, give it to Him.

37
00:39:01.714 --> 00:39:04.714
Give it to Him.

38
00:39:04.714 --> 00:39:06.714
Are you happy? Give it to Him.

39
00:39:06.714 --> 00:39:09.714
Are you sad? Give it to Him.

40
00:39:09.714 --> 00:39:13.714
Do you have faith? Give it to Him.

41
00:39:13.714 --> 00:39:16.714
Don't you see it? Give it to Him.

42
00:39:16.714 --> 00:39:19.714
Are you proud? Give it to Him.

43
00:39:19.714 --> 00:39:22.714
Do you have faith? Give it to Him.

44
00:39:22.714 --> 00:39:25.714
Don't you see it? Give it to Him.

45
00:39:41.714 --> 00:39:43.714
You are worth it, Jesus.

46
00:39:43.714 --> 00:39:46.714
You are worth everything.

47
00:39:46.714 --> 00:39:48.714
You have paid for everything.

48
00:39:48.714 --> 00:39:50.714
You are Lord over everything.

49
00:39:50.714 --> 00:39:52.714
You have a plan for our lives.

50
00:39:52.714 --> 00:39:54.714
You have a plan for your church.

51
00:39:54.714 --> 00:39:57.714
And I bless you in the name of Jesus,

52
00:39:57.714 --> 00:40:00.714
that you will not give up, but that you will know

53
00:40:00.714 --> 00:40:03.714
that your life is safe in the hands of God.

54
00:40:03.714 --> 00:40:05.714
Hallelujah.

