94
00:42:11.714 --> 00:42:14.714
Yesterday I spoke with Joshua at the table and with Olivia

95
00:42:14.714 --> 00:42:17.714
and we were reading the Bible

96
00:42:17.714 --> 00:42:19.714
and we were talking about a sacrifice.

97
00:42:19.714 --> 00:42:25.714
The sacrifice that God asked of Abraham, namely his son Isaac.

98
00:42:25.714 --> 00:42:28.714
And we talked about what a sacrifice is.

99
00:42:28.714 --> 00:42:33.714
And Joshua said, a sacrifice is when you give something.

100
00:42:33.714 --> 00:42:37.714
And then I said to Joshua, that's right, but a sacrifice is always

101
00:42:37.714 --> 00:42:42.714
when you give something that really costs you something.

102
00:42:42.714 --> 00:42:45.714
And I said to Joshua, it's very strange

103
00:42:45.714 --> 00:42:48.714
because when you receive something that you actually don't find that interesting

104
00:42:48.714 --> 00:42:50.714
and we had an example.

105
00:42:50.714 --> 00:42:54.714
I hadn't eaten everything from my plate, there was still some left.

106
00:42:54.714 --> 00:42:56.714
I wasn't hungry anymore, so I was done eating

107
00:42:56.714 --> 00:42:58.714
and I still had some left on my plate.

108
00:42:58.714 --> 00:43:02.714
Is this a good offering, a leftover?

109
00:43:02.714 --> 00:43:04.714
Is that a good offering?

110
00:43:04.714 --> 00:43:07.714
And Joshua said, no, that is not a good offering.

111
00:43:07.714 --> 00:43:10.714
It should actually be the first of what you have.

112
00:43:10.714 --> 00:43:14.714
It should actually be when you still really say, I look forward to this

113
00:43:14.714 --> 00:43:16.714
and then you say, I give this away.

114
00:43:16.714 --> 00:43:21.714
It should cost you something, that is a sacrifice.

115
00:43:21.714 --> 00:43:26.714
And God says to Abraham, I want your son.

116
00:43:26.714 --> 00:43:31.714
And Abraham says, oh my gosh, this is my first.

117
00:43:31.714 --> 00:43:33.714
This is my beloved.

118
00:43:33.714 --> 00:43:35.714
This is everything I want.

119
00:43:35.714 --> 00:43:37.714
This is my very best.

120
00:43:37.714 --> 00:43:40.714
And then God says, yes, but I want that.

121
00:43:40.714 --> 00:43:42.714
But here comes the catch.

122
00:43:42.714 --> 00:43:44.714
Here comes the catch.

123
00:43:44.714 --> 00:43:49.714
Normally, it's the case that when you receive something for free

124
00:43:49.714 --> 00:43:51.714
it's not so difficult to give that away.

125
00:43:51.714 --> 00:43:53.714
That's not really a sacrifice.

126
00:43:53.714 --> 00:43:57.714
Something that you have received and give away is not really a sacrifice.

127
00:43:57.714 --> 00:44:01.714
Normally, it's the case that what you work for, what truly belongs to you,

128
00:44:01.714 --> 00:44:05.714
when you give that away, that is a sacrifice.

129
00:44:05.714 --> 00:44:07.714
What belongs to you.

130
00:44:07.714 --> 00:44:09.714
But here is the thing.

131
00:44:09.714 --> 00:44:12.714
Do you know what God says to Abraham?

132
00:44:12.714 --> 00:44:16.714
The moment when Abraham wants to give his very best to God.

133
00:44:17.714 --> 00:44:20.714
At that moment, God says, wait Abraham.

134
00:44:20.714 --> 00:44:23.714
You don't have to give your very best.

135
00:44:23.714 --> 00:44:28.714
I will give you what you can give to me.

136
00:44:28.714 --> 00:44:32.714
And this is the model for every believer in Jesus Christ.

137
00:44:32.714 --> 00:44:38.714
Everything we give to God is given to us by Him.

138
00:44:38.714 --> 00:44:41.714
This is amazing when you think about it.

139
00:44:41.714 --> 00:44:44.714
Your job, your life, your family.

140
00:44:44.714 --> 00:44:48.714
It is all given to us by God.

141
00:44:48.714 --> 00:44:52.714
So that we can give something back to Him.

142
00:44:52.714 --> 00:44:54.714
He is the provider.

143
00:44:54.714 --> 00:44:58.714
God who says, I give seed to the sower.

144
00:44:58.714 --> 00:45:00.714
And bread for eating.

145
00:45:00.714 --> 00:45:04.714
In other words, everything comes from God.

146
00:45:04.714 --> 00:45:07.714
And I want you to always consider this faith,

147
00:45:07.714 --> 00:45:09.714
